<title>USA: TABLE-Johnson Controls sells $150 mln notes.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Johnson Controls sells $150 mln notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Johnson Controls Inc was priced Tuesday according to lead manager JP Morgan Securities Inc.</p>
<p>Johnson Controls makes automated building controls, batteries, and plastics.</p>
<p>BORROWER JOHNSON CONTROLS INC</p>
<p>AMT $150 MLN	 COUPON 7.125 PCT  MATURITY 7/15/2017</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 99.377  FIRST PAY DATE 1/15/1998</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S A2    YIELD 7.184 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P SINGLE-A  SPREAD 57 BPS     CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>((U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212-859-1678 ))</p>
